-- Migration 63 down: drop the source-level aggregate embedding field (R.0).
--
-- REMOVE FIELD drops the SCHEMAFULL field definition on `source`. The aggregate
-- vector is purely derived data (mean-pool of the source's chunk vectors in the
-- `source_embedding` table) — no authoritative content is lost; a forward
-- re-apply + re-run of the populate function fully reconstructs it. Mirrors the
-- migration 43 / 52 down convention.

REMOVE FIELD IF EXISTS embedding ON TABLE source;
